You call upon the earth to create a blinding, corrosive cloud in an area of radius 4 for 5 turns.

Each turn, this cloud deals [71, 96, 115, 131, 145 (TL1-5; MP 100)] acid damage to each foe with a 25% chance to blind and a [23%, 28%, 31%, 34%, 36% (TL1-5)] chance of burning away one magical sustain or beneficial magical effect.

The damage increases with your Mindpower.
